# Runtime = full code, zero AI

This bot must work **offline from any LLM** once installed.

- Execution path (`python3 hinge_wda.py`, WDA, filters, replies) uses **only local code + `prefs.local.yaml`**.
- Do **not** add runtime calls to OpenAI/Anthropic/Cursor APIs, embeddings, or paid token services for liking/filtering/messaging.
- New capabilities (e.g. image checks) must be **deterministic libraries or local models the user opts into** — never a required cloud LLM in the hot loop.
- AI/agents are allowed for **install, setup, and coding help only** — not for each profile at runtime.

If a feature needs “intelligence”, implement it as code rules, heuristics, or an optional local dependency documented in README/`prefs.example.yaml`.
